# The ONLY setting the app reads. It is the address of Shisho's online service
# and is not a secret: it is compiled into the app. Leave it empty to build an
# offline-only app (the Shisho, Library digest and account features then say
# they are not connected).
#
# Android emulator -> the computer running the site:   http://10.0.2.2:3000
# Real phone on the same Wi-Fi:                         http://<this computer's LAN address>:3000
# Production:                                           https://<your deployed site>  (HTTPS only)
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Restart `npx expo start` after changing it.
# NEVER put a model key, a Supabase service key or any other secret here:
# anything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ is readable by anyone who has the app.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
